  "captureNotes": [
    "Existing specimens import AppShellTopBar, ScenarioHub, ScenarioDetailModal and BackgroundPickerModal. The outer canvas reproduces the Index.tsx wrapper.",
    "At 1440 CSS pixels, card hover revealed actions, scaled the image to 1.1, retained the important base shadow and did not translate the wrapper.",
    "At 390 CSS pixels, the source header exceeded the viewport (554px scroll width); the grid fit. The source detail shell kept its 340px cover column and left insufficient room for the synopsis. These captures document limitations, not recommended responsive behavior.",
    "The source story-detail surface has no dialog role and remained open after Escape in this fixture. Its backdrop and close button supply pointer dismissal; it does not use DialogContent.",
    "The proposed Chapter Preview uses actual dialog content, named title/description and a responsive scrolling shell. Escape returned focus to its trigger, and Begin invoked the local callback and closed.",
    "The proposed Background Appearance uses a named Radix Slider Thumb with the shared Slider styling. White selection and keyboard opacity changes immediately updated the local preview; Reset restored black at 30%.",
    "At 390 CSS pixels, both proposed examples fit the viewport. The chapter shell uses a single auto-scrolling container; the background preview remains visible above the compact controls. This checks local reference layout, not production feature delivery.",
    "Captured through the Codex browser. Crops retain screenshot pixels. Imported source hashes identify the current fixture dependencies; they do not by themselves prove source correctness or full file review."
  ]
}
